1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,659
This is a £1 tent.

2
00:00:01,879 --> 00:00:03,980
And this is a £1,000 tent!

3
00:00:04,339 --> 00:00:09,740
Well, we will be going up against each other to see if we can spend 24 hours in these tents.

4
00:00:10,179 --> 00:00:15,279
Along the way, there will be chances to win luxury and basic items.

5
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:19,530
But to get these items, we will have to face various different challenges.

6
00:00:20,219 --> 00:00:22,300
Like digging rare bug fossils from a rock.

7
00:00:22,539 --> 00:00:25,820
And try to cut a perfect star out of a honeycomb cookie.

8
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,719
If any of us leaves our tent, we will be instantly disqualified.

9
00:00:30,879 --> 00:00:32,600
So, get your camping gear ready!

10
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:36,740
And let's see who can survive this 24-hour camping challenge!

